[2.24, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.354, "o", "\u001b[1mSampo demo\u001b[0m: no model is called; the real sampo CLI and the Ward's hook run in a throwaway repo and a Sampo home of its own.\r\n"]
[2.854, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m1. The repo has a bug: calc.add(2, 3) returns -1. Claude tries to edit calc.py before any task exists.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.888, "o", "  \u001b[1;31mRefused\u001b[0m: Sampo: no active task in this project, so <demo>/repo/calc.py can't be edited yet. One command starts a small task: sampo task new \"<title>\" --type FIX --tier S --ac \"<done when>\" --step \"<step>\" --focus (bigger work: /sampo:intake; sampo next says what's next).\r\n"]
[5.088, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m2. So it plans the work first: a brief with a done-when and the command that proves it.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
