[7.299, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.789, "o", "  T-0001 [FIX S] add() subtracts \u2014 planned (<demo>/foreman/state/projects/repo-0bdd03/tasks/T-0001-add-subtracts.md)\r\n"]
[8.989, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m3. Mid-task, a careless command: rm -rf ~ (here ~ is the demo's own fake home).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.024, "o", "  \u001b[1;31mRefused\u001b[0m: Ward: blocked rm-outside: recursive delete of <demo>/home. To authorize: sampo task set T-0001 --allow rm-outside (records it in the brief), then retry.\r\n"]
[11.224, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m4. Test first: Claude writes test_calc.py and records it as the step's evidence.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
