[25.163, "o", "  \u001b[1;32mclosed\u001b[0m: T-0001 done (verification: strong \u2014 3 ran, 0 typed, red\u2192green).\r\n  Nothing needed from you: each criterion was proved by its own check.\r\n  T-0001: committed 81f1138 (2 files). Undo: git revert --no-edit 81f1138\r\n  Ledger: head 1a64f9bdcb76ac5d (15 chained lines)\r\n  Reused 1 run(s) that already passed: python3 -m unittest -q test_calc (this tree and world)\r\n  Title card: <demo>/foreman/state/projects/repo-0bdd03/cards/T-0001.svg\r\n  Landed: committed 81f1138 \u00b7 not pushed\r\n"]
[26.366, "o", "\r\nThe demo's repo and Sampo home are deleted: nothing was left behind. To start for real: sampo init in your repo, or just give Claude a request.\r\n"]
